263-g001"/></fig><fig id="F2" position="float"><label>Figure 2</label><caption><p>Immunohistochemical staining of Ki-67 in the gastric cancer tissue. Ki-67 immunoreactivity was found in the nuclei of the cancer cells (&#x000d7;200).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-22-263-g002"/></fig><fig id="F3" position="float"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Detection of apoptotic cells and bodies (arrow) by TUNEL staining. An apoptotic body is characterized by a pyknotic nucleus surrounded by a shrunken cytoplasm, and the apoptotic body is separated from the surrounding cells by a halo (&#x000d7;400).</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-22-263-g003"/></fig><fig id="F4" position="float"><label>Figure 4</label><caption><p>Kaplan-Meier survival curve correlating disease specific survival with the positive (solid line) or negative (dotted line) expression of c-FLIP.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-22-263-g004"/></fig><table-wrap id="T1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Correlation between the c-FLIP expression and the clinicopathological parameters of gastric cancer</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-22-263-i001"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p><sup>*</sup>WD, well differentiated; MD, moderately differentiated; PD, poorly differentiated adenocarcinoma</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>The relationship between the KI and the status of the c-FLIP expression in gastric cancer</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-22-263-i002"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>KI, Ki-67 labeling index</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p>The relationship between the KI and the differentiation grade in gastric cancer</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-22-263-i003"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>KI, Ki-67 labeling index; <sup>*</sup>WD, well differentiated; MD, moderately differentiated; PD, poorly differentiated adenocarcinoma</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T4" position="float"><label>Table 4</label><caption><p>The relationship between the AI and the status of the c-FLIP expression in gastric cancer</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-22-263-i004"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>AI, Apoptotic index</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="T5" position="float"><label>Table 5</label><caption><p>The relationship between the AI and the differential grade in gastric cancer</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-22-263-i005"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>AI, Apoptotic index; <sup>*</sup>WD, well differentiated; MD, moderately differentiated; PD, poorly differentiated adenocarcinoma</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>